Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My attempt to infiltrate Libelle Castle failed due to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,an unexpected encounter with Her Highness,\Nthe Princess Ashuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:11.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And during the scuffle,\NAkari had disappeared off somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Momo uncovered proof that Manon Libelle\Nwas involved in the production of monstrine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but fell into an enemy trap that left her critically injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the proof Momo found,\Nthe knights have taken action to sequester Libelle Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The time has come to confront Manon Libelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Around the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:39.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was in my true state that\NMenou doesn't know about,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,face-to-face with Miss Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:44.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to figure out...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why so many things are happening now in Libelle\Nthat never took place in my past regressions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.79,0:00:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aren't you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because you've suspended these people in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:01.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More importantly,\Nisn't there something you want to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.79,0:01:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So? Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it you want to ask so badly that it\Nwas worth leaving Miss Menou's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Last night, I snuck into your room to investigate...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, it didn't help me figure anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How do you know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.29,0:01:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because someone told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:39.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That you made the world Regress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.75,0:01:44.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And not just once or twice either, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.29,0:01:46.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.67,0:01:50.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pandæmonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Manon Libelle...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She may be more trouble than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Pandemonium"? You mean that fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A confinement of fog that has lasted a thousand years...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you believe me if I told you I dispelled it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:51.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.63,0:03:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:04:00.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not something the likes of me\Ncould ever do anything about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.00,0:04:03.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking to answer riddles, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've regressed countless times,\Nbut none of this ever happened in Libelle before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You changed something, didn't you?\NIn order to take revenge for your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Revenge for my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I heard these people talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They said this only happened\Nbecause you wanted vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sounds like there's a slight misunderstanding,\Nso let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, my mother was a Lost One.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.71,0:04:39.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then she was Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.29,0:04:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But unlike you, she wasn't summoned by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She was guided here by the stars,\Na "lost one" in the truest sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm told the Fourth in this city were overjoyed at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:05:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They had managed to secure someone with a\NPure Concept outside of the Faust's knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As the representative of the Fourth,\Nmy father Count Libelle married the Lost One,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in order to keep her by his\Nside and make use of her power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, my father didn't make my mother use her\Npower, not even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because at some point,\Nhe had truly fallen in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As you must know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The more a Lost One uses her power,\Nthe more she loses her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was what my father was afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That my mother would forget\Nthe time they spent together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A beautiful story, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.38,0:05:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you know,\Nstories like that always come with a cruel ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:01.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Manon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You actually have an older sister, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A bright, active girl who's full of energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-Mother...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:32.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold that in like your life depends on it, Lost One.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you invoke that, your child will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roughly ten years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,my mother was murdered by an\NExecutioner who came here: Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.63,0:06:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's your revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because Menou is the apprentice\Nof the one who killed your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:08.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I loved my mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:14.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I understand the Church's reasoning that\Notherworlders' Pure Concepts are dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:17.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They had reason enough to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So if it's revenge I'm after, I suppose it's against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My father convinced the Fourth not to worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:29.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,because I would inherit my\Nmother's power in her stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So that my mother wouldn't have to use her power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.42,0:07:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I turned out to be an ordinary person,\Nand never inherited a Pure Concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:43.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was told time and time again...\N{\rSubtitle-2}We should have... from the beginning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:47.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that I was "a letdown"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and "worthless."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.83,0:07:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So of course that twisted my personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to become taboo...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Exactly like they expected of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no point in trying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyone suspended with my power\Nis shielded from external forces, so-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.83,0:08:11.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to live up to their expectations,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:16.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and prove just how idiotic those expectations were.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm in my rebellious phase, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.33,0:08:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I'm starting to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You... or the you in this instance of Time,\Nobtained a way to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why the happenings in\NLibelle changed drastically.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:38.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was powerless as my ordinary self.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I will now become taboo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:09:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought so. This power is stronger than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right! There was one exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One thing my magecraft failed to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That white globule I saw in Garm's ceremonial hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then her power is on par with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems you're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M... Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh... this... isn't... D-Don't think I'm being weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what do I do?\NI showed myself in this state to Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was my mistake for letting you out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a bunch of questions, but that can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:56.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:04.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are some knights keeping watch,\Nso ask them to get Pastor Sicilia for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:05.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about you, Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go apprehend Manon Libelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:17.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How nice of you to come out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:24.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bid you welcome, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Manon Libelle, you've stepped into the realm of taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For that I must execute you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is lovely, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's clear to me now that you've said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As of now, I've truly become free and independent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I will rebel against this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,with this power I wield!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I embody the Fourth,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who seek to liberate the world in the\Nname of freedom and independence!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have become what the Fourth is truly meant to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.63,0:11:12.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please kill me as well, just like my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why should I have to kill a little brat like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the child of my mother, a Lost One!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I must have some power-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pure Concepts adhere to the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And a soul, unlike the body,\Nis not genetic in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.42,0:11:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It belongs solely to the individual born with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In short, you're not taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let us fight to our hearts' content.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She stood me up, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Though I find it hard to believe that Momo\Nwould do this without good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Princess Ashuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to let me be unless it's an emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Some of the Fourth have turned themselves in,\Nand there's a high-ranking one among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.71,0:12:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it Manon Libelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:39.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, an elderly man.\NProbably one of the original members.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:41.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How lovely, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those eyes... I can't get enough of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:37.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:54.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:57.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, this is as good as I can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:14:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, it was so much better than\Ncontinuing to do nothing with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:07.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This has been fun, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It wasn't fun for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't like killing people, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:20.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These roles in life, they're reprehensible, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:26.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why,\Nwhen trying to break free of restraints,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the people in this world turn to things that are taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you think that justifies you becoming taboo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I want to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is that you're allowed to change too, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like anyone else,\Nyou have the right to rebel against the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you wished it of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Miss Akari would be happy\Nto use her powers for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.67,0:14:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:56.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're surprisingly transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But she said "countless times,"\Nso perhaps it's you who should be helping her change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's my policy not to divulge another girl's secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Menou, you've come after the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me be the final sacrifice I offer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:45.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you could have done... Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Things were already set in motion\Nlong before you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.25,0:15:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only reason I was able to produce\Nmonstrine was thanks to this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Best of luck, Miss Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unlike me, she's more than just a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you're safe, Ms. Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have worried you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll shelter you at the church.\NPlease come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! The sky is so blue. And big!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's such nice weather today!\NI'm sure it's going to be a lovely day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right? Don't you think so, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You worked so hard for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for providing me with a\Ndecent number of sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.63,0:17:01.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meeting new people is one of my favorite things!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is she using her own death as the\Nsacrifice required to summon herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If so, in a different sense from Akari,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she can't be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must be a priestess!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is the girl with the cherry blossom pink hair okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope she's fine and didn't succumb to the poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:38.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you're a demon\Nsummoned by Manon Libelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:43.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm human!\NFrom the top of my head to the tips of my toes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:45.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You probably are human, technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This impossibly vile conjuring is\Ndefinitely that of a Pure Concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.75,0:17:56.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An entity that crossed the line as a Lost One...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The most taboo of taboos...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.83,0:18:01.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A Human Error.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:04.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Must I repeat myself again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.21,0:18:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were all forced to do Manon Libelle's bidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We are the victims here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Forced to," eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:13.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The girl even laced our council's food with monstrine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With monstrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A Human Error.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The remnant of what was once a Lost One.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The worst monster imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's awful! Don't call me a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.83,0:18:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, I did a bunch of practice inside that\Ngirl and finally learned how to talk again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.58,0:18:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So I want to chat some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The things I love more than anything are\Nsinging and dancing and watching movies!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have no time for that.\NBecause my job is to kill entities like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill who? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm going to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:59.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your Pure Concept, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's my meaning in life, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.63,0:19:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! Maa, you'll "destroy it"? My Pure Concept?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh. But it's true I'm super weak and I die really easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, not even the Ivory hero managed to destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:26.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Ivory hero"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! You don't know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it was so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The strongest, greatest Pure Concept\Never in all of humankind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A hero who was forced into protecting this stupid world!\NBut no one remembers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.13,0:19:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When the hero did so much for the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I think I remember hating you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hate us for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:57.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I haven't met someone like you in a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:03.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming on this wonderful day, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I welcome you to beat, crush,\Nand mash me up as you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's more than enough of me so don't hold back.\NCast your inhibitions aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.42,0:20:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What you're about to witness is a B movie screening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The entertainment of gods and\Ndemons determined by dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Demons! Monsters! Dark Lords!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mysterious wonders both divine and demonic.\NThe dice are governed by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows what will happen next?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.25,0:21:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I sense a conjuring!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's so massive... and twisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sacrificed... because of the monstrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fear, excitement, and thrills-the triple package!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.17,0:21:50.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The singing, dancing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,embodiment of the panic film genre!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:56.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's me, "Pandæmonium"!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:22:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's have a riveting, enthralling,\Nand very fun fight to the death...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.83,0:22:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.13,0:23:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Pandæmonium.
